    "detailed_description": "In Block Dude Deluxe, your mission is simple\u2014reach the exit in each level. But to do that, you'll need to strategically stack and move blocks to create pathways, staircases, and bridges to navigate complex environments. Every level presents a unique puzzle that will challenge your problem-solving skills and test your ability to think ahead.<br><br>Features:<br><br>   <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Challenging Puzzles: Each level is designed to push your strategic thinking with increasing difficulty as you progress.<br>    </li><li>Block Manipulation Mechanics: Move, stack, and reposition blocks to solve intricate puzzles.<br>    </li><li>Varied Environments: Explore different settings that add new twists and obstacles to your path.<br>    </li><li>Simple Controls, Complex Challenges: Easy to pick up but difficult to master, Block Dude Deluxe is accessible to all players while offering deep puzzle gameplay for those who seek a challenge.<br>    </li><li>Level Progression: Unlock new, more difficult levels as you master the mechanics and solve earlier puzzles.</li></ul><br>Whether you're a casual player looking for a fun puzzle experience or a dedicated gamer seeking to master intricate levels, Block Dude Deluxe offers an engaging and rewarding challenge.",
    "about_the_game": "In Block Dude Deluxe, your mission is simple\u2014reach the exit in each level. But to do that, you'll need to strategically stack and move blocks to create pathways, staircases, and bridges to navigate complex environments. Every level presents a unique puzzle that will challenge your problem-solving skills and test your ability to think ahead.<br><br>Features:<br><br>   <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Challenging Puzzles: Each level is designed to push your strategic thinking with increasing difficulty as you progress.<br>    </li><li>Block Manipulation Mechanics: Move, stack, and reposition blocks to solve intricate puzzles.<br>    </li><li>Varied Environments: Explore different settings that add new twists and obstacles to your path.<br>    </li><li>Simple Controls, Complex Challenges: Easy to pick up but difficult to master, Block Dude Deluxe is accessible to all players while offering deep puzzle gameplay for those who seek a challenge.<br>    </li><li>Level Progression: Unlock new, more difficult levels as you master the mechanics and solve earlier puzzles.</li></ul><br>Whether you're a casual player looking for a fun puzzle experience or a dedicated gamer seeking to master intricate levels, Block Dude Deluxe offers an engaging and rewarding challenge.",
    "short_description": "Your primary goal is to reach the exit door in each level. stack blocks strategically, creating pathways and staircases that allow you to traverse the environment. Each level presents a unique puzzle, requiring careful planning and precise execution",
